      "source": "https://www.wikixm.com/us/la/bayou-lourse/overview",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town’s identity is rooted in the surrounding wetlands and bayous, with waterways historically serving as trade routes.",
